# Optional. The wardrobe and collage work without any AI service, and the shared
# image-editing Space is used by default. No paid provider is used by either option.

# Strongly recommended: a free Hugging Face access token.
# Create a free account, then Settings -> Access Tokens -> a read token.
# The Space runs on ZeroGPU. Without a token you share a small per-IP allowance
# that is often already used up, and generation fails within a second or two.
# HF_TOKEN=hf_your_token_here

# Optional override for the image-editing Space.
# Must expose a Gradio `/infer` endpoint with the Qwen-Image-Edit signature.
# Prefer a Space whose @spaces.GPU() requests a short duration: ZeroGPU checks the
# requested duration against your remaining quota, so Spaces asking for 180s are
# refused outright on a free allowance even though the work itself is quick.
# Defaults to https://linoyts-qwen-image-edit-2511-fast.hf.space
# IMAGE_EDIT_URL=https://qwen-qwen-image-edit-2511.hf.space

# Option 2 (your own GPU): a Gradio 5+ service running ai-space/outfit_api.py.
# Takes precedence over the shared Space when set.
# FASTFIT_URL=https://your-account-your-space.hf.space
